            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この語が後ろにある本は 1 巻とみなさない"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A book with this word right after the series name is not volume 1": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A book with this word right after the series name is not volume 1"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この語がすぐ後ろに付く本は 1 巻とみなさない"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A compilation is in the wrong place": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A compilation is in the wrong place"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "総集編・番外編をどこに入れるか"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A field read from the name is never overwritten. These also go into names that matched no format.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A field read from the name is never overwritten. These also go into names that matched no format."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名前から読めた欄は上書きしません。どのフォーマットにも合わなかった名前にも入ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A format reads a bracket as a field only at the head of a name, right after the authors, or at the end. A bracket in the middle of a title could never have become a field, so it is not counted as left over. The ones at the title's head and end are still counted — they may have been a source work or a volume.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A format reads a bracket as a field only at the head of a name, right after the authors, or at the end. A bracket in the middle of a title could never have become a field, so it is not counted as left over. The ones at the title's head and end are still counted — they may have been a source work or a volume."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "フォーマットが括弧を欄として解析するのは、名前の先頭・著者の直後・末尾だけです。タイトルの途中の括弧はどのフォーマットでも欄になりえないので、未割当として数えません。タイトルの先頭と末尾の括弧は、原作や巻数だった可能性があるので数えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A group of books → the name of their series": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A group of books → the name of their series"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "まとまった本 → そのシリーズ名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A name cannot start with “$”": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A name cannot start with “$”"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「$」で始まる名前は使えません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new rule goes to the top of the list, where it is looked at before the others.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A new rule goes to the top of the list, where it is looked at before the others."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "足した規則は並びの先頭に入り、ほかより先に見られます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rule of that name already exists": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A rule of that name already exists"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ名前の規則があります"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rule set is a list of name shapes. qooMeta tries them from the top and reads the name with the first shape that fits the whole of it. The count shows how many of your names it read in full — a name whose brackets ended up inside a field is not counted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A rule set is a list of name shapes. qooMeta tries them from the top and reads the name with the first shape that fits the whole of it. The count shows how many of your names it read in full — a name whose brackets ended up inside a field is not counted."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ルールセットは、ファイル名のフォーマットを並べたものです。上から順に試し、名前全体に合った最初のフォーマットで解析します。数字は、そのルールセットで解析できたファイル名の数です(括弧が欄にならず値に残った名前は数えません)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rule set of that name already exists": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A rule set of that name already exists"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ名前のルールセットがあります"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rule set you save there appears here at once.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A rule set you save there appears here at once."
