    "The Stackroom XML that ShelfRow takes in. Its import reads only the title, the authors, keywords A and B and the memo (Neta); the genre, series and volume fields are not read.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Stackroom XML that ShelfRow takes in. Its import reads only the title, the authors, keywords A and B and the memo (Neta); the genre, series and volume fields are not read."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ShelfRow が取り込む Stackroom XML です。取り込みが読むのはタイトル・著者・キーワード A / B・メモ(Neta)だけで、ジャンル・シリーズ・巻数の欄は読まれません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Stackroom XML that StackNest takes in. It builds a new library rather than adding to one you already have, and its import has no memo field.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Stackroom XML that StackNest takes in. It builds a new library rather than adding to one you already have, and its import has no memo field."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StackNest が取り込む Stackroom XML です。新しいライブラリを作る形式で、既存のライブラリには足せません。メモの欄は取り込みにありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bundled rules could not be read": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bundled rules could not be read"
          }
