            "state": "translated",
            "value": "変更できませんでした"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The changes you made to “%@” take effect only once you save them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The changes you made to “%@” take effect only once you save them."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」に加えた変更は、保存するまで反映されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The changes you saved to this rule set are lost. The ones you saved under a name of your own stay.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The changes you saved to this rule set are lost. The ones you saved under a name of your own stay."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このルールセットに保存した変更が消えます。名前をつけて保存したルールセットは残ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The character on the left is compared as the one on the right": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The character on the left is compared as the one on the right"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "左の字を右の字と同じとみなして比較します"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The characters that split the authors read from a name. A format can set its own instead.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The characters that split the authors read from a name. A format can set its own instead."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名前から読んだ著者を分ける文字です。フォーマットごとに別の区切りを決めることもできます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The closest format is the one on line %1$lld (%2$@); it looked for the next fixed character at character %3$lld — the marked part.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The closest format is the one on line %1$lld (%2$@); it looked for the next fixed character at character %3$lld — the marked part."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いちばん近いのは %1$lld 行目のフォーマット (%2$@) です。%3$lld 文字目にあるはずの固定文字が見つかりませんでした —— 印の部分です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The closest is the format on line %1$lld; it looked for the next fixed character at character %2$lld and did not find it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The closest is the format on line %1$lld; it looked for the next fixed character at character %2$lld and did not find it."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いちばん近いのは %1$lld 行目のフォーマットです。%2$lld 文字目にあるはずの固定文字が見つかりませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The corrections you have not saved are lost.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The corrections you have not saved are lost."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存していない修正は失われます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The exported file holds the names of your books. Save it somewhere of your own.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The exported file holds the names of your books. Save it somewhere of your own."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "書き出すファイルには蔵書の名前が含まれます。手元の場所に保存してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The part left after the series name is tried **from the top down**, and the first way of reading that can make sense of it settles the volume. Turning one off is how you stop it reading something it should not.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The part left after the series name is tried **from the top down**, and the first way of reading that can make sense of it settles the volume. Turning one off is how you stop it reading something it should not."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "シリーズ名より後ろに残った部分を、**上から順に**試し、最初に読めた読み方で巻数を決めます。読んでほしくない書き方は、その読み方を切ってください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The qooViewer library JSON, taken in with “Load library data”. It can hold only the title, the authors, the series and the volume as written.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The qooViewer library JSON, taken in with “Load library data”. It can hold only the title, the authors, the series and the volume as written."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "qooViewer の保存データ JSON です(「保存データの読み込み」で取り込みます)。持てる欄はタイトル・著者・シリーズ・巻数の表記だけです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rule sets you saved under a name of your own are deleted, and the bundled ones go back to their bundled contents.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The rule sets you saved under a name of your own are deleted, and the bundled ones go back to their bundled contents."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自分で名前をつけて保存したルールセットは削除され、標準のルールセットは標準の内容に戻ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rules do not hold their words themselves; they point at a list here. One list can serve several rules, and what you add to it acts everywhere it is used.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The rules do not hold their words themselves; they point at a list here. One list can serve several rules, and what you add to it acts everywhere it is used."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "規則は語を自分で持たず、ここの一覧を指しています。1 つの一覧を複数の規則が使うことがあり、足した語は使っている所すべてで効きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same format appears twice": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The same format appears twice"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じフォーマットが 2 つあります"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same work (a duplicate)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The same work (a duplicate)"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ作品として扱う"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same work shows up twice": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The same work shows up twice"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ本が 2 冊あるように見える"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same work twice": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The same work twice"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ作品の重複"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The series name is cut off, or carries something extra": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The series name is cut off, or carries something extra"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "シリーズ名が途中で切れる・余分が残る"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The series name of “X side A” and “X side B” is “X”": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The series name of “X side A” and “X side B” is “X”"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「X side A」「X side B」のシリーズ名は「X」になります"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The trailing parenthesis is the source work. A parenthesis inside the brackets holds the second author onwards.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The trailing parenthesis is the source work. A parenthesis inside the brackets holds the second author onwards."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "末尾の丸括弧は原作です。角括弧の中の丸括弧は、2 人目からの著者です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The trailing parenthesis is the volume, when it is digits only. It also reads the shape “Series (volume) - author”.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The trailing parenthesis is the volume, when it is digits only. It also reads the shape “Series (volume) - author”."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "末尾の丸括弧は巻数です(数字だけのとき)。「シリーズ名 (巻数) - 著者」の形も解析します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The way from a title to a series name and a volume, in three steps. Each step takes what the one before it produced; they cannot be reordered.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The way from a title to a series name and a volume, in three steps. Each step takes what the one before it produced; they cannot be reordered."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "タイトルからシリーズ名と巻数ができるまでの、3 つの工程です。前の工程の結果を次が受け取ります。並べ替えはできません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The word is not a mark of any kind: it stays in the title, and neither the rules below nor the ways of reading a volume touch it. Put such a rule above the one you want it to escape.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The word is not a mark of any kind: it stays in the title, and neither the rules below nor the ways of reading a volume touch it. Put such a rule above the one you want it to escape."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この語は何も示さないものとして、タイトルの一部に残します。下の規則にも、巻数の読み方にも取られません。例外は、効かせたくない規則より上に置きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The “-” or “~” left at the end of a series name": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The “-” or “~” left at the end of a series name"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "シリーズ名の末尾の「-」「~」など"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are unsaved changes": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There are unsaved changes"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存していない変更があります"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no format at all": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There is no format at all"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "フォーマットがありません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no separator at all": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There is no separator at all"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "区切りがありません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These settings also sit in “All the settings”, each in its own place — they are the same settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These settings also sit in “All the settings”, each in its own place — they are the same settings."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ここの設定は「詳しい設定」にもそれぞれの場所で並んでいます(同じものです)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These settle **what to do** with what qooMeta found. There is no single right answer, so choose what suits your books.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These settle **what to do** with what qooMeta found. There is no single right answer, so choose what suits your books."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "qooMeta が見分けた結果を**どう扱うか**の設定です。正解が 1 つあるわけではないので、蔵書に合わせて選びます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This name reads better than with the saved rule set": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This name reads better than with the saved rule set"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存済みのルールセットより、この名前はうまく解析できています"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This name reads worse than with the saved rule set": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This name reads worse than with the saved rule set"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存済みのルールセットより、この名前は解析できなくなっています"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This part of a name is **not read as a format bracket**, even when it is one: it does not divide fields, and it stays in the title or whatever value holds it. Use it so that the “(2026)” of “Garden of the Moon (2026)” becomes neither a source work nor a volume.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This part of a name is **not read as a format bracket**, even when it is one: it does not divide fields, and it stays in the title or whatever value holds it. Use it so that the “(2026)” of “Garden of the Moon (2026)” becomes neither a source work nor a volume."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ここに書いた文字列は、括弧であっても**フォーマットの括弧として解析しません**(欄の区切りにならず、タイトルなどの値にそのまま残ります)。「月の庭 (2026)」の「(2026)」を原作や巻数にしないために使います。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This rule has no values to change; you can only let it act or hold it back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This rule has no values to change; you can only let it act or hold it back."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この規則に変更できる値はありません(有効・無効の切り替えのみ)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tidying the series name (in this order)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tidying the series name (in this order)"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "シリーズ名を整える"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tighten the same settings the other way: split on a difference qooMeta is now ignoring, or ask for more shared characters before two titles count as one series.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tighten the same settings the other way: split on a difference qooMeta is now ignoring, or ask for more shared characters before two titles count as one series."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同じ設定を逆に締めます。いま無視している違いで分けるか、同じシリーズと認めるのに必要な共通部分を長くしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
